# Prepared benchmark data, model weights, and everything a run produces. All of it is
# reproducible from the code plus the upstream releases, and none of it is small.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash so these match ONLY the repository root. An unanchored
# `data/` also matches `memlife/data/` -- the loader package -- and silently drops it from
# the commit.
/data/
/models/
/runs/

# ...and because this folder may live inside a parent repository whose own .gitignore has an
# unanchored `data/`, re-include the package explicitly. A deeper .gitignore wins, but only
# if it un-ignores the DIRECTORY: git will not look inside an excluded one.
!memlife/data/
!memlife/data/**

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
build/
dist/
